  chapters:
  - act: 0
    title: OUTSKIRTS
    subtitle: Gas station and water tower
    firstLevel: 1
    lastLevel: 10
    bossName: Lieutenant Rattler
    bossPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f19d6d9679eb84ca8b60d7ace9271b8c, type: 3}
    bossTaunt: Rangers in MY town? The boys will fill you with holes!
    introLines:
    - The Red Scorpions hold the road into Dustwater.
    - Clear the outskirts, Commander!
    outroLines:
    - Rattler is down! The outskirts are free.
    - Townsfolk are coming back. Time to rebuild!
  - act: 0
    title: MAIN STREET
    subtitle: Saloon and market
    firstLevel: 11
    lastLevel: 20
    bossName: Big Jaws
    bossPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9b2ec47a0778147279a6caeabacf5eea, type: 3}
    bossTaunt: Main Street is mine. Nobody walks past Big Jaws!
    introLines:
    - Main Street is the heart of Dustwater.
    - Big Jaws guards it with an iron grip.
    outroLines:
    - Big Jaws is finished!
    - Only the Scorpion Fort remains.
  - act: 0
    title: SCORPION FORT
    subtitle: Vex's stronghold
    firstLevel: 21
    lastLevel: 30
    bossName: Boss Vex
    bossPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1f6b737ea4a944bba87ccb4d8e98eb01, type: 3}
    bossTaunt: You took my town, Commander. You will not take my fort!
    introLines:
    - Vex hides in his fort at the edge of town.
    - This is the final push, Commander!
    outroLines:
    - Vex runs off into the desert. Dustwater is free!
    - Keep patrolling the roads, Commander.
  - act: 1
    title: PINE PASS
    subtitle: The snowy road north
    firstLevel: 31
    lastLevel: 40
    bossName: Sergeant Frostbite
    bossPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5fa325c68ce4949ceaf379931285e022, type: 3}
    bossTaunt: Turn back, Rangers. Up here the cold kills before I do!
    introLines:
    - The White Wolves guard the pass to Frostpeak.
    - Bundle up and push through, Commander!
    outroLines:
    - Frostbite is down. The pass is open!
    - Frostpeak lies beyond the frozen lake.
  - act: 1
    title: FROZEN LAKE
    subtitle: Thin ice, thick armor
    firstLevel: 41
    lastLevel: 50
    bossName: Ice Hammer Olaf
    bossPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9cc238d2ece194d368aa5b001fbede7c, type: 3}
    bossTaunt: My hammer cracks ice. And Rangers!
    introLines:
    - The road crosses the frozen lake.
    - Olaf's hammer squad waits on the ice.
    outroLines:
    - Olaf sinks into the snow. The lake is ours!
    - 'Next stop: the lumber camp.'
  - act: 1
    title: LUMBER CAMP
    subtitle: Sawmills and log walls
    firstLevel: 51
    lastLevel: 60
    bossName: Big Timber
    bossPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8699e28550ac54b4793ef854711a6a01, type: 3}
    bossTaunt: I chop trees bigger than you every morning!
    introLines:
    - The Wolves turned the lumber camp into a fortress.
    - Big Timber runs the sawmills.
    outroLines:
    - Timber! The camp is free.
    - The lumberjacks are joining Frostpeak.
  - act: 1
    title: FROSTPEAK TOWN
    subtitle: Cabins under the snow
    firstLevel: 61
    lastLevel: 70
    bossName: Mayor Snowjaw
    bossPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0787ab45055944b0c83d846135d3bae4, type: 3}
    bossTaunt: I am the mayor now. Elections are cancelled!
    introLines:
    - Frostpeak's streets are full of Wolves.
    - Their fake mayor, Snowjaw, rules the town.
    outroLines:
    - Snowjaw is out of office!
    - The town is free, but the mine is still taken.
  - act: 1
    title: CRYSTAL MINE
    subtitle: Tunnels and ice crystals
    firstLevel: 71
    lastLevel: 80
    bossName: Foreman Crag
    bossPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f9d2fde3da0dd4e77b2f2e678eaa5eda, type: 3}
    bossTaunt: Every crystal in this mountain belongs to the Wolves!
    introLines:
    - The Wolves are digging up Frostpeak's crystals.
    - Shut down Foreman Crag's mine!
    outroLines:
    - Crag is buried in his own rubble.
    - Grimfang's fortress is next.
  - act: 1
    title: WOLF FORTRESS
    subtitle: Stone walls of the pack
    firstLevel: 81
    lastLevel: 90
    bossName: Warlord Grimfang
    bossPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 70b238afdc20c4e728fd5bfa2fb8afa0, type: 3}
    bossTaunt: The pack never loses. Howl, my wolves!
    introLines:
    - Grimfang leads the White Wolves from his fortress.
    - Break through the stone walls!
    outroLines:
    - Grimfang falls. The pack scatters!
    - Vex is hiding on the summit.
  - act: 1
    title: THE SUMMIT
    subtitle: Vex's last hideout
    firstLevel: 91
    lastLevel: 100
    bossName: Boss Vex
    bossPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c5d2065082a0846de979beb495b36f2b, type: 3}
    bossTaunt: You followed me to the top of the world? Then you fall from here!
    introLines:
    - Vex has fled to the summit of Frostpeak.
    - End this for good, Commander!
    outroLines:
    - Vex is captured at last!
    - Frostpeak is free. The Rangers are heroes of the north!
